fix bug where saved SpimDataFilteringAndGrouping was
 discarded before it could be used by the asynchronous global optimization
 (introduced in acef72c39cbf097729924faebb8b92c825642e33)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the premature discarding of the `savedFilteringAndGrouping` data in `StitchingExplorerPanel.java` before it could be utilized by the asynchronous global optimization process. This led to a situation where the necessary filtering and grouping data was not available when needed, resulting in the global optimization failing to function correctly.

